{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55654","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十二 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 五十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岂是疎慵僻爱山，且图余事不相关。\n休夸凤诏千年贵，难敌禅扉半日闲。\n透水戏鱼随浪没，投巢孤鹤带云还。\n自然得到无心地，寂寂虚堂一景闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55654.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55654","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}